UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Course Overview</h4><div> <p>This qualification would apply to individuals with various frontline managerial job titles including team leaders, executive officers, program consultants, office managers and program coordinators. Individuals in these roles may possess substantial experience in a range of settings but seek to further develop their skills across a wide range of business functions.</p> </div><h4>Who Should Undertake This Qualification</h4><div> <p>This qualification is aimed at students who would like to enhance their skills and knowledge to create further educational and employment opportunities for themselves.</p> <p><strong>Target Group 1</strong></p> <p>The first target group for this qualification is for existing business professionals requiring a formal qualification through recognition of prior learning. This group of candidates will normally consist of:</p> <ul> <li>Executive officers</li> <li>Program consultants</li> <li>Program coordinators</li> <li>Manager</li> <li>Supervisor etc.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Target Group 2</strong></p> <p>This group of candidates will normally consist of:</p> <ul> <li>People looking for a career change</li> <li>People who need this qualification for employment purposes</li> <li>People seeking a formal qualification</li> <li>People with some business experience seeking a formal qualification</li> <li>People taking on an executive role within their organisation and seeking a formal qualification</li> </ul> <p>If you do not identify yourself with one of the target groups, please call the office on <strong>+61 2 8844 1000</strong> and one of our training consultants will discuss this further with you so that an informed decision can be made.</p> </div><h4>Course Subjects</h4><div> <p>Total number of units = 12</p> <p>There are 5 core units for this qualification, plus 7 elective units</p> <table> <tbody> <tr> <td>Unit Code &amp; Title</td> <td>Core/Elective</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBCRT511 – Develop critical thinking in others</td> <td>C</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBFIN501 – Manage budgets and financial plans</td> <td>C</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBOPS501 – Manage business resources</td> <td>C</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBSUS511 – Develop workplace policies and procedures for sustainability</td> <td>C</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBXCM501 – Lead communication in the workplace</td> <td>C</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBOPS502 – Manage business operational plans</td> <td>E</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBOPS503 – Develop administrative systems</td> <td>E</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBHRM525 – Manage recruitment and onboarding</td> <td>E</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBTWK503 – Manage meetings</td> <td>E</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBCRT512 – Originate and develop concepts</td> <td>E</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBLDR523 – Lead and manage effective workplace relationships</td> <td>E</td> </tr> <tr> <td>BSBPEF501 – Manage personal and professional development</td> <td>E</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div>',
